{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act16d5_level_act16d5_01_beg",
  "groupId": "act16d5",
  "stageId": "act16d5_01",
  "title": "初醒",
  "storyCode": "WR-1",
  "avgTag": "行动前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act16d5/level_act16d5_01_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "2ebfbc3a1c93788727e8974f8f9101080b90264ff5279e8517db56ea49edf02d",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_140",
      "text": "为啥子？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "说书人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_138",
      "text": "因为那个跛脚书生在那晚切实完成了诺言，切实画出了“世间从未有过之物”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_140",
      "text": "咋感觉和书上写的内容不大一样？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "说书人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_138",
      "text": "老夫子来不及说出为什么，或者压根就说不出为什么就咽了气。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "说书人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_138",
      "text": "于是坊间流传的说辞，就只有跛脚书生从春风得意到失魂落魄的这么一段。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "说书人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_138",
      "text": "至于真相如何，恐怕无人知道了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_140",
      "text": "可是画没见过的东西，那有啥难的嘛，我回去乱涂一幅，你们不也没见过。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "说书人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_138",
      "text": "欸，话不能这么说。你从没见过大湖，但见过雨后积水，我便告诉你，湖是很多的积水。说到底，你还是见过的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "说书人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_138",
      "text": "这跛脚书生，厉害就厉害在这儿了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_140",
      "text": "那照你这么说，他到底画了啥？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "说书人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_138",
      "text": "谁知道呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_140",
      "text": "嗨，能不能别老讲这么复杂的，咱不爱听啊，啥时候讲讲其他的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孩子",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_142",
      "text": "我要听上次那“形单影只向天去，雌雄双剑分天下”的大结局！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "说书人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_138",
      "text": "会讲的，都会讲的。天下讲不完的事，我用寥寥百年的阳寿去讲，要是还奢求面面俱到，就有点贪得无厌了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "说书人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_138",
      "text": "既然你们想听，那下一回，咱们就讲点别的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孩子",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_142",
      "text": "好诶！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "说书人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_138",
      "text": "老规矩，我这张嘴，不值钱。但是诸位的茶钱，得看着给。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "说书人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_138",
      "text": "今儿似乎有几位新面孔，不知三位客人对我这些奇闻怪谈，可还满意？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_144",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "......这是真事儿？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "说书人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_138",
      "text": "若是说有个书生染了矿石病，遂愿之前便郁郁而终，我倒确信是件真事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "说书人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_138",
      "text": "添油加醋，方有滋味啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "在理！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "说书人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_138",
      "text": "多谢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "说书人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_138",
      "text": "只不过，我也不知道这些奇闻野史，到底有几分是真的......只是有这方面的兴趣，仅此而已。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "说书人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_138",
      "text": "话说回来，我虽然不是什么正儿八经的说书人，也在镇上以此打发了许久光阴，不过愿意来听我胡说八道的，其实就那么几位。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "说书人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_138",
      "text": "这看着三位面生，不知？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "咳——（使眼色）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "啊——是了是了，我这两位朋友，远道而来，要找个人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "不过这二位在咱们大炎这儿人生地不熟的，所以我就略帮小忙，代为引路，不知先生怎么称呼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "说书人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_138",
      "text": "我离家多年，早就弃了旧名不用。早年舞文弄墨，自号“煮伞居士”，虽有些恬不知耻，但也沿用至今。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "好意境！好意境啊！这不巧了，小弟也是被迫无奈，背井离乡，如今也只好借“乌有”二字暂代姓名，不如你就喊我乌老弟呗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "（我就说他这名字是编的吧——！？）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_144",
      "text": "（嘘......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "（克洛丝？你发现什么了？）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_144",
      "text": "（嗯？啊，没有啦，我只是觉得看他每次都要生编硬套很好玩嘛。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "（......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "说书人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_138",
      "text": "原来同是天涯沦落人，那不知道三位要找的人，是谁？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "嗨，俗话说得好，相逢即是缘，真是巧得不能再巧了。我们要找的人，也是个画家。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "说书人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_138",
      "text": "......画家？这小镇不大，可从未听说过有什么画家。是个什么样的人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "呃......恩人？您给说说？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "是一位女性。呃，头上应该长着奇特的角。还会一些奇特的法术。然后......然后......是个画家。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "说书人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_138",
      "text": "就这样？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "......就这样。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "说书人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_138",
      "text": "你这么一说，就更没印象了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "唔，这就奇了怪了......莫非二位恩人要找的人，已经离开了这里？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "说书人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_138",
      "text": "这小镇极少有来客，要是如各位所说，那位奇人当给我们留下印象才是。我可以托人帮你问问。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "好，好，那就不叨扰先生了，我们这就——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "这就......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "说书人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_138",
      "text": "乌有先生？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "喂，你怎么了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "啊，嘿嘿，我们......我们是从哪儿进来的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "你在说什么，我们不是——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "说书人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_138",
      "text": "——沿着这条小道，便可离开园林。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "说书人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_138",
      "text": "想必几位是跟着人群来这里，迷了路吧？哈哈，我这园子不大不小，实在认不得路，问个佣人便是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "嘿......你瞧我这糊涂的，怎么就记不住了呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "说书人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_138",
      "text": "若是关于那位画家，找到了什么线索需要帮忙，尽管问我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "说书人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_138",
      "text": "我还有点事情，诸位，不送。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "诶，多谢多谢，不用送，不用送。二位恩人，我们先走吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "等等——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "接下来，咱们去哪儿瞧瞧？这茶馆，驿站，园子都去过了，还有啥地儿可能有线索的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "......我们到这里多久了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "唔，怎么突然问这个？大概......三两天时日？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "你确定？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "啊哈哈，嗨，多半是昨天晚上没睡好，我有点犯迷糊嘞。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_144",
      "text": "小炎熔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "嗯......我感觉到了......但是很模糊的......好像......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_144",
      "text": "这种时候还是要跟着直觉走。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "直觉告诉我，现在情况很麻烦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_144",
      "text": "是某种精神层面的源石技艺......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "嗯......法术的话......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "二位恩人，还嘀咕啥呢？再不走快点，天就要黑啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "说什么呢，天色还——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "——天......色？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_144",
      "text": "我们竟然从来没有看过天空......？明明只要一抬头就能发现的......真奇怪。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "恩、恩人，这是啥情况？你看那边儿，好像......好像都出月亮了呀！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "可现在不是大白天吗，桥那头怎么都点灯笼了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "看身后......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "耶？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "......另一个方向的天边，那是......是太阳？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_144",
      "text": "啊，是不是从那头到这头走个来回，就相当于\"走过了\"一天一夜？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "这还真......新奇。总是听年说大炎地大物博无奇不有......还有这种景观？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "唔，等等，我口袋里好像有什么东西......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "这是，年给我的护身符......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "慢着......慢着！不对，不对！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "什么叫“这种景观”啊，我刚才在想什么......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_144",
      "text": "啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "乌有！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "诶——？我在，我在！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "这里到底是不是泥翁镇！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "这......这还用说......呃......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "这，这仔细看看似乎是有点不对，可这附近也没有别的镇子了呀！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "......还是不对，不对。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "克洛丝，我们从罗德岛出发，先抵达了勾吴城，补给之后，翌日上午出城。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_144",
      "text": "然后我们在前往灰齐山的荒原上看见了一辆撞毁的车——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "——然后二位恩人从那些畜生手里救下了我？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_144",
      "text": "只是把它们带到了适合筑巢的新窝而已啦。它们也挺不容易的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "然后呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "然后我们......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_144",
      "text": "嗯嗯，然后我们直接登上了灰齐山，找到了一间破茅屋。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "我推开了那儿的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "......门？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "钟声？哪里的钟声？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_140",
      "text": "敲钟了？敲钟了！喂，快去把家里人都喊起来！动作快！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_140",
      "text": "怎么回事！都这么长时间了！为什么会是今天！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "那个......！请问发生什么了！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_140",
      "text": "你们，你们是外人？敲钟就说明西边的山里来怪物啦！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_140",
      "text": "那些怪物见不得光，只要跑到有太阳的地方，就安全了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "怪，怪物？什么怪物？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_140",
      "text": "哎呀，没空和你瞎唠叨啦！别挡着我，我得把老婆带到这儿来呀！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孩子",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_142",
      "text": "妈妈！妈妈！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_140",
      "text": "都在这儿了吗？还少谁！快去找找！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "恩人，恩人，咱们也赶紧去避难吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "说是只要跑到有太阳的地方就没事儿了？那咱们赶紧——恩人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "......克洛丝。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_144",
      "text": "准备好啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "——恩人！？别闹啦，我们自个儿都是一团浆糊，还是先躲躲再说吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "诶！诶诶！这怎么就冲过去了！唉！我的好恩人呐，你们——等我，等我一下啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
